[TITLE]
Heerlen ON mines - reduced EPANET thermal test for RMT integration
- Derived from nieuw-model-hh4-06(2).inp, version 20260623
- Default seasonal pattern: days 1-182 warm production, days 183-364 cold production, day 365 idle.
- Well coordinates and elevations are the original mine tie-ins listed below.
    HLH-GT-03-01 uses node 20193 to represent HH1 + HH3.
    HLH-GT-02-05 uses node 875 to represent HH2 + HH5.
    HLH-GT-04-06 uses node 20196 to represent HH4 + HH6.
    HLN3-1 uses node 321 to represent HLN1 + HLN3.
    HLN2-5-6 uses node 1707 to represent HLN2 + HLN5 + HLN6.
    HLN4 uses node 1866 to represent HLN4.


